1
00:00:00,604 --> 00:00:01,934
(Bernadette:)Well, we don't exactly.

2
00:00:01,939 --> 00:00:04,069
(Bernadette:)I'm a microbiologist
for the research team.

3
00:00:04,074 --> 00:00:05,574
(Beverly:)Oh, what are you
currently developing?

4
00:00:05,576 --> 00:00:07,606
(Bernadette:)Some exciting new
anti-anxiety drugs.

5
00:00:07,611 --> 00:00:08,911
(Beverly:)That's interesting.

6
00:00:08,912 --> 00:00:12,012
(Beverly:)I just attended a lecture
on pediatric anxiety.

7
00:00:12,015 --> 00:00:14,515
(Amy:)Oh, was it, uh,
Dr. Jenofski?

8
00:00:14,518 --> 00:00:15,588
(Amy:)I just saw
his TED Talk!

9
00:00:15,586 --> 00:00:16,816
BEVERLY:
It was.

10
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,450
(Bernadette:)Let's get back to Penny.

11
00:00:18,455 --> 00:00:19,755
(Bernadette:)Hey, weren't you telling me

12
00:00:19,756 --> 00:00:21,286
(Bernadette:)something great
about your company car?

13
00:00:21,291 --> 00:00:22,761
(Penny:)Um...

14
00:00:22,759 --> 00:00:24,829
(clears her throat)

15
00:00:24,828 --> 00:00:28,468
(Penny:)It has seat warmers.

16
00:00:28,465 --> 00:00:30,595
(knocking at door)

17
00:00:30,601 --> 00:00:32,401
SHELDON:
Amy! Amy!

18
00:00:32,402 --> 00:00:34,102
Amy!
Come in.

19
00:00:34,104 --> 00:00:35,734
(Sheldon:)Hello, everyone.

20
00:00:35,739 --> 00:00:37,139
Oh, Beverly, good to see you!

21
00:00:37,141 --> 00:00:38,911
(Sheldon:)I'd love to chat,
but there's a line

22
00:00:38,909 --> 00:00:40,779
(Sheldon:)that could start moving
any minute, so let's do this.

23
00:00:40,777 --> 00:00:41,907
(Sheldon:)Amy?

24
00:00:41,912 --> 00:00:43,842
(Sheldon:)A proper apology
requires three steps.

25
00:00:43,847 --> 00:00:46,047
(Sheldon:)Step one...
an admission of wrongdoing.

26
00:00:46,049 --> 00:00:47,979
(Sheldon:)Amy, I was wrong.
Step two...

27
00:00:47,985 --> 00:00:50,115
(Sheldon:)a promise never
to repeat said action.

28
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,820
(Sheldon:)Amy, that action will never be
repeated, and that's a promise.

29
00:00:52,823 --> 00:00:55,323
(Sheldon:)Step three... an earnest request
for forgiveness.

30
00:00:55,325 --> 00:00:56,595
(Sheldon:)Amy, I hope you can forgive me.

31
00:00:56,593 --> 00:00:57,863
(Sheldon:)And I hope you
do it right now,

32
00:00:57,861 --> 00:00:59,231
(Sheldon:)'cause there's an Uber
waiting downstairs,

33
00:00:59,229 --> 00:01:00,859
(Sheldon:)and I don't want to repeat
this apology nonsense

